# ============================================================
# Alembic Migration Script Template
# ============================================================
# PURPOSE:
# Template used by Alembic to generate new migration files.
# Each migration file represents a database schema change.
#
# USAGE:
# alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of change"
# This generates a new file in migrations/versions/ with
# upgrade() and downgrade() functions.
# ============================================================
